{"strongs": "H1965", "word": "מְלַח", "translit": "he.khal", "root": "מלח", "morph": "A:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "palace, temple", "definition": "[ הֵיכַל ] noun masculine palace, temple (Assyrian loan-word; Biblical Hebrew; also Palmyrene היכלא and הכלא Lzb 259 SAC 43 ); — emphatic הֵיכְלָא Ezra 4:14 +; construct הֵיכַל Dan 4:26 suffix הֵיכְּ לִי Dan 4:1 , לֵהּ - Dan 6:19 — 1. place of king Dan 4:1 ; Dan 4:26 ; Dan 5:5 ; Dan 6:19 ; Ezra 4:14 (see מְלַח ). 2. temple: \\ \\ a. in Jerusalem Dan 5:2 ; Dan 5:3 ; Ezra 5:14 a.; Ezra 5:15 ; Ezra 6:5 (twice in verse). \\ \\ b. in Babylon Ezra 5:14 b.c.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9472')\">BDB9472</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1965')\">H1965</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H1964')\">H1964</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H4415')\">H4415</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9471')\">BDB9471</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9473')\">BDB9473</entry></div><p> [<bdbarc>הֵיכַל</bdbarc>] <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>palace, temple</highlightword> (Assyrian loan-word; Biblical Hebrew; also Palmyrene <bdbarc>היכלא</bdbarc> and <bdbarc>הכלא</bdbarc> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ldzb')\">Lzb<sup>259</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Cook')\">SAC<sup>43</sup></lookup>); — emphatic <bdbarc>הֵיכְלָא</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:14\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,14)\">Ezra 4:14</ref> +; construct <bdbarc>הֵיכַל</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 4:26\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,26)\">Dan 4:26</ref> suffix <bdbarc>הֵיכְּ לִי</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 4:1\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,1)\">Dan 4:1</ref>, <bdbarc>לֵהּ</bdbarc>- <ref ref=\"Dan 6:19\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,19)\">Dan 6:19</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>place</highlight> of king